# pursuit — environment example
# This project needs NO API keys by design (course rule: Login, not API key).
# Moves are pure Python; the optional LLM layer runs on LOCAL Ollama (no key).
# Gmail reporting uses OAuth files (NOT env vars) under ./secrets/ — git-ignored:
#   secrets/credentials.json   (Google Cloud OAuth client, send-only scope)
#   secrets/token.json         (created on first consent)
# Optional overrides:
# PURSUIT_CONFIG_DIR=config/police     # which peer config tree to load
# OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434    # local model endpoint (no key)
